    <task id="LOCAL-00019" summary="Improve sync reliability and add manual synchronization features&#10;&#10;This commit introduces a more robust synchronization strategy and enhances the UI with manual sync controls and per-job sync status indicators.&#10;&#10;- **Enhanced Sync Logic**: Implements a clock-skew tolerant conflict resolution strategy in `SupabaseRepository`. It now uses a 2-minute window to compare local and remote changes, falling back to server-managed `updatedAt` timestamps to resolve ties.&#10;- **Manual Sync Support**: Adds the ability to trigger a manual synchronization from the job list. The UI now displays a progress bar and detailed status labels (attempted/acknowledged/failed) during manual sync operations.&#10;- **Sync Status Indicators**: Introduces `JobSyncDotState` and a `SyncDotIndicator` component to provide visual feedback on the synchronization state of individual jobs (Synced, Pending, or Never synced).&#10;- **Improved Work Tracking**: Updates `OutboxSyncWorker` to report granular progress via `WorkData`, allowing the ViewModel to observe and communicate sync results to the user.&#10;- **Refactored Loading State**: Replaces simple boolean flags with a reference-counting mechanism (`beginLoading`/`endLoading`) in `JobViewModel` to better manage overlapping background tasks.">
